        <item>
            <title>EasyColor 1.0.2</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 12:43:10 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.0.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in 1.0.2</h3><ul><li>Track clicks now find an empty spot in the row, so tracks with extra controls get coloured reliably</li><li>Runs stop cleanly when Logic is showing a dialog instead of clicking into it</li><li>Track names with quotes or line breaks no longer break the colour-conflict prompt</li><li>Colour rules: the longest match wins, and your own rule beats a built-in one</li><li>Marker drafts are remembered between launches</li><li>Feedback can attach files</li><li>Buy and trial links carry your licence key, so buying while subscribed cancels the old plan automatically</li></ul>]]></description>
